#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:5
#: a3adcd7320ff4dada2db866bb9cbdcb6
msgid "SingleCopter and CoaxCopter"
msgstr "SingleCopter和CoaxCopter"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:10
#: 4acd1fe59b8141e0b3fff9a59b188e8e
msgid ""
"SingleCopter with vertically mounted autopilot.  Image courtesy of "
"\"droner\""
msgstr "竖装飞控的SingleCopter。图片由\"droner\"提供"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:12
#: 83e6c98bcc7341ed96ec5f0ef21a1cc9
msgid ""
"Single and Coax copters have one or two propellers to provide thrust and 2 "
"to 4 individual flaps to provide roll, pitch and yaw control.  The "
"difference between a SingleCopter and a CoaxCopter is:"
msgstr ""
"单旋翼和同轴双旋翼飞行器有一个或两个螺旋桨提供推力，2至4个独立舵片提供横滚、俯仰和偏航控制。SingleCopter与CoaxCopter的区别在于："

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:14
#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:69
#: 287ff22e3c484d0a8d6b6d48a34a727c 6c73364c50354af1acbbb1493cf86035
msgid "*SingleCopter*"
msgstr "*SingleCopter*"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:16
#: c778953a3a094ae3b6c1fd574545bcad
msgid "has a single motor and 4 independent flaps."
msgstr "有一个电机和4个独立舵片。"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:17
#: b1e908abbbeb4fd2996bc0e1732c3ffa
msgid ""
"the vehicle's yaw is controlled by adjusting all four fins to point slightly"
" clockwise or counter-clockwise."
msgstr "飞行器偏航通过将所有四个舵片调整为略微顺时针或逆时针来控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:19
#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:75
#: 292ea325eb744950bfd95a89a71a0995 de332ccb92ac428ea842c8664952977a
msgid "*CoaxCopter*"
msgstr "*CoaxCopter*"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:21
#: 97b2092e97ba4635bcfb5d37637cd955
msgid ""
"has two counter-rotating motors and at least 2 independent flaps (4 "
"individual servos/flaps can be used but fins on opposite sides of the "
"vehicle will move together)"
msgstr "有两个反向旋转电机和至少2个独立舵片（也可使用4个独立舵机/舵片，但飞行器两侧相对的舵片将联动）"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:22
#: c0a61b325ded4403a04b2ba2bfddc63d
msgid ""
"the vehicle's yaw is controlled by adjusting the speeds of the two motors.  "
"I.e. speeding up the clockwise motor while slowing down the counter-"
"clockwise motor will cause the vehicle to rotate counter-clockwise"
msgstr "飞行器偏航通过调整两个电机的转速来控制。即加快顺时针电机转速同时降低逆时针电机转速，将使飞行器逆时针旋转"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:25
#: d55930d610e149a1bd1ffdd88a11b19f
msgid "Mounting and Connecting the autopilot"
msgstr "安装和连接飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:30
#: 9922022f93b0471285503ec97e61a654
msgid ""
"By default the autopilot should be mounted similar to a \"plus\" quad.  The "
"board should be horizontal with the white arrow pointing towards the forward"
" flap. As with other vehicles the board should be placed close to the center"
" of gravity of the vehicle. If it is more convenient to mount the autopilot "
"pointing up, set :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION <AHRS_ORIENTATION>` to 25 "
"(Pitch270)."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，飞控应类似于\"十\"字四轴的方式安装。飞控板应水平放置，白色箭头指向前方舵片。与其他飞行器一样，飞控板应放置在飞行器的重心附近。如果更方便朝上安装，请将"
" :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION <AHRS_ORIENTATION>` 设置为25（Pitch270）。"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:34
#: d70fad9b5b50484bb7b02885089a16e2
msgid ""
"Connect the servos to the autopilot's outputs, normally used in Copter for "
"motors, and assigned in  their SERVOx_FUNCTION as Motor 1 through Motor 6:"
msgstr "将舵机连接到飞控的输出端（通常在Copter中用于电机），在其SERVOx_FUNCTION中分配为电机1至电机6："

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:36
#: 9553b39de84f4157afa7e3ff1ec63554
msgid "Motor 1 : Forward Flap"
msgstr "电机1：前舵片"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:37
#: 162763f148ab48b4ab65f818e058287d
msgid "Motor 2 : Right Flap"
msgstr "电机2：右舵片"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:38
#: 3b1330c02fbf4abbbe453ab60a34fa7e
msgid "Motor 3 : Back Flap (optional for CoaxCopter)"
msgstr "电机3：后舵片（CoaxCopter可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:39
#: f349dc32eb4d4cf2b60950b77b4852bf
msgid "Motor 4 : Left Flap (optional for CoaxCopter)"
msgstr "电机4：左舵片（CoaxCopter可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:40
#: 064ad9635202479ba28a0e509f5eda93
msgid "Motor 5 : Upper (CCW) Motor"
msgstr "电机5：上部（逆时针）电机"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:41
#: b441f38e1e304e5084deed35ddc2d805
msgid "Motor 6 : Lower (CW) Motor (CW, only for CoaxCopter)"
msgstr "电机6：下部（顺时针）电机（顺时针，仅适用于CoaxCopter）"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:44
#: 96f6d172c99940a2b8610d5b346a47e6
msgid "Loading the Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:46
#: 82def39f3d9e440b9db074b866f733b5
msgid ""
"All of the multicopter firmware (quad, hexa, octa, octaquad, y6, tri, "
"single, coax) including single and coax copter have been consolidated into a"
" single firmware. This means the quad (or other multicopter) firmware should"
" be loaded onto the autopilot and then please set:"
msgstr ""
"所有多旋翼固件（四轴、六轴、八轴、八轴四臂、Y6、三轴、单旋翼、同轴双旋翼）包括单旋翼和同轴双旋翼已合并为一个固件。这意味着应将四轴（或其他多旋翼）固件加载到飞控，然后请设置："

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:49
#: 1778fce298494cbd88d659397f03e283
msgid ""
":ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` to 8 for SingleCopter or 9 for CoaxCopter"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` 设为8（SingleCopter）或9（CoaxCopter）"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:52
#: b47ce52dcdd846e1b7625db3062010cd
msgid "Setting up the flaps"
msgstr "设置舵片"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:54
#: 14584729b40f4250b4f66394ca0c5517
msgid ""
"The neutral position, direction of movement, minimum and maximum deflection "
"of each flap can be configured with the SERVOx_TRIM, SERVOx_REVERSED, "
"SERVOx_MIN and SERVOx_MAX parameters (where \"x\" is the RC output number)."
"  For example these are the parameters for the forward flap/servo which is "
"connected to RC output 1:"
msgstr ""
"每个舵片的中立位置、运动方向、最小和最大偏转可通过SERVOx_TRIM、SERVOx_REVERSED、SERVOx_MIN和SERVOx_MAX参数进行配置（其中\"x\"为RC输出编号）。例如，连接到RC输出1的前方舵片/舵机的参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:56
#: f6413729b82d49f6a613719610628cdb
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO1_MIN <SERVO1_MIN>`: the forward flap/servo's lowest PWM value "
"before it hits its physical limits."
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO1_MIN <SERVO1_MIN>`：前方舵片/舵机在达到物理极限前的最低PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:57
#: 05f316316b4e4f5f94c43c861779c5c4
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO1_MAX <SERVO1_MAX>`: the forward flap/servo's highest PWM value "
"before it hits its physical limits."
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO1_MAX <SERVO1_MAX>`：前方舵片/舵机在达到物理极限前的最高PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:58
#: 11def063f87847e890b71355abbd9a30
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO1_TRIM <SERVO1_TRIM>`: the forward flap/servo's PWM value close "
"to what is required to keep the vehicle from spinning."
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO1_TRIM <SERVO1_TRIM>`：接近使飞行器不旋转所需的前方舵片/舵机PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:59
#: b8d9e72696fb4fd6b71c3a6dab0334aa
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO1_REVERSED <SERVO1_REVERSED>`: the forward flap/servo's reverse "
"setting.  0 = servo moves in default direction, 1 to reverse direction of "
"movement."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO1_REVERSED <SERVO1_REVERSED>`：前方舵片/舵机的反向设置。0=舵机按默认方向运动，1=反向运动方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:62
#: 9267e736fed4453fa38072c0068e9b2f
msgid "Testing the flap movement"
msgstr "测试舵片运动"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:64
#: 29415904b07c4722bef32b25bd74353f
msgid "Remove the propellers"
msgstr "拆下螺旋桨"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:65
#: 4b5f4a86d4ae483f8a5ddedf409f67f0
msgid "Place the vehicle on a flat surface in front of the pilot"
msgstr "将飞行器放置在飞手前方的平坦地面上"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:66
#: 5289ed1827c94c2f8e63380d7de812b6
msgid "Arm the vehicle in Stabilize mode"
msgstr "在Stabilize模式下解锁飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:67
#: 66c32f63386c4220a917bd3e29aa1a48
msgid ""
"Raise the throttle on the transmitter and move the roll, pitch and yaw "
"sticks and confirm the flaps move as described below"
msgstr "在遥控器上增大油门，移动横滚、俯仰和偏航摇杆，确认舵片按以下描述运动"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:71
#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:77
#: 091c7e1e2f9944fc90100e18aaed02fd 569ca799961a4ae796c9f7b35b6b8a86
msgid "transmitter roll right makes forward and back fins move right"
msgstr "遥控器右横滚使前后舵片向右移动"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:72
#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:78
#: 1ff2311c4e374e76aff6c7b350bc2387 614535da2cf747029153f00c32cf0e29
msgid "transmitter pitch forward causes left and right fins to move forward"
msgstr "遥控器俯仰向前使左右舵片向前移动"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:73
#: a2c007270bc6493bb72944b68a89f772
msgid ""
"transmitter yaw right causes forward fin to move left, right fin to move "
"forward, back fin to move right, left fin to move back"
msgstr "遥控器右偏航使前舵片向左移动、右舵片向前移动、后舵片向右移动、左舵片向后移动"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:79
#: 99030efc4c864801997f535829a23f18
msgid ""
"transmitter yaw right causes no change in fin movement but motor speed "
"changes.  Top (ccw) motor should speed up, bottom (cw) should slow down."
msgstr "遥控器右偏航不改变舵片运动，但电机转速发生变化。上部（逆时针）电机应加速，下部（顺时针）电机应减速。"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:82
#: 902668950e284454b034ea34d7b4c6c5
msgid "Video of the first ArduPilot powered SingleCopter"
msgstr "首架ArduPilot驱动的SingleCopter视频"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:88
#: e44e45f3a332457e8e193317c94267db
msgid ""
"Below are non-ArduPilot single copters and coax copters to provide "
"inspiration:"
msgstr "以下是非ArduPilot单旋翼和同轴双旋翼飞行器，供参考启发："

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:90
#: 53c2c84091ae4ec7b1afec1bc3f987d2
msgid ""
"The vehicle shown below uses a counter-rotating motor pair with both "
"propellers above the motors and the shaft of the bottom motor passes up "
"through the hollow shaft of the top motor."
msgstr "下图所示飞行器使用一对反向旋转电机，两个螺旋桨均位于电机上方，下部电机轴穿过上部电机的空心轴。"

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:95
#: 0383460fe0fc41f99df19e3cda7efb7c
msgid ""
"The vehicle below has two motors mounted back to back with one propeller "
"above and the other below with appropriate support struts."
msgstr "下图飞行器有两个背靠背安装的电机，一个螺旋桨在上方，另一个在下方，并配有适当的支撑支柱。"
